.idea/

# NOTE: Do not gitignore src/content/{releases,performances,projects} or
# src/assets/{releases,performances,projects} here. Keystatic local mode skips
# gitignored files, so collection entries would disappear from the Admin UI.
#
# End users: deploy with GitHub mode (see docs/deploy-vercel.md). Content lives
# in their fork — no sibling repo required.
#
# Maintainers: private catalog may live in a sibling repo and be symlinked in.
# See docs/private-content.md. On this machine, .git/info/exclude can still keep
# those symlinks out of `git add .` without breaking Keystatic.
